<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE V: </span><span id="S5.T5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Performance Degradation after Supervised Finetuning.</span> We analyze the performance degradation after finetuning on a new domain with incorrect state estimation gap compared to the performance on the original domain on Push Cube task. Results show that our online imitation pretraining approach suffers less after finetuning on a new domain compared to existing offline imitation learning approaches.</figcaption>
</figure>
